      "snippet_id": "SNP-001",
      "snippet_text": "\"For one, Payhip offers a wider range of built-in features including a course builder, product variants, marketing tools, an affiliate program, and more advanced customization. Gumroad, on the other hand, is a bit easier to use since it's mainly a solution that allows creators to accept payments online.\"",
